  "_detail": {
   "uuid": "3834c015-a6a9-4b86-a9df-1d0320838846",
   "name": "Director Clinical Operations",
   "description": {
    "company": "<meta><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Africa Clinical Research Network (ACRN) is an African-led clinical research organization building the next generation of trial capacity across the continent. We work with existing hospitals, research units, and investigators to enable high-quality clinical research—from investigator-initiated studies to late-phase and registration trials—while strengthening local systems, skills, and infrastructure.</span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">ACRN operates as a pan-African site management and research delivery platform, combining strong clinical operations, regulatory expertise, data and digital systems, and quality management. Our model is practical and embedded: we focus on making trials work in real settings, reducing friction for sites, sponsors, and regulators, and delivering reliable, audit-ready data.</span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We partner closely with governments, regulators, academic institutions, and industry to expand Africa’s role in global clinical research, while ensuring that studies generate local value—through workforce development, institutional strengthening, and improved patient care.</span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">At ACRN, you’ll work on meaningful, complex projects with global impact, alongside a multidisciplinary team that values rigor, accountability, and innovation. We are building something durable, ambitious, and distinctly African—and we are looking for people who want to help shape it.</span></p>",
    "role": "<meta><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">About the role</strong></b></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">The </span><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Africa Clinical Research Network (ACRN)</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> is seeking a </span><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">strategic, experienced, and tech-savvy leader</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> to oversee clinical operations across our multi-country clinical trial portfolio.</span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">This is a </span><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">senior enterprise-level role</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> responsible for setting clinical operations strategy, ensuring high-quality trial delivery, and maintaining </span><b><strong style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">continuous inspection readiness</strong></b><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> across all studies and regions.</span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">What you'll do</strong></b></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">. Define and lead clinical operations strategy across multi-country trial portfolios</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Oversee end-to-end trial delivery (start-up, execution, monitoring, close-out)</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Ensure compliance with ICH-GCP, regulatory requirements, and sponsor standards</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Drive portfolio performance, risk management, and operational governance</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Lead and mentor senior clinical operations leaders across functions</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Maintain continuous inspection readiness and support audits/inspections</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Collaborate with cross-functional teams (Regulatory, Data, Quality, Medical, Finance)</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Engage with sponsors and stakeholders on operational strategy and delivery</span><br><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">• Drive continuous improvement, scalability, and capability building across clinical operations</span></p><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><b><strong style=\"font-size:18pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Qualifications</strong></b></p><ul data-pattern=\"discCircleSquare\" data-depth=\"1\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;\"><li style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:3px 0px;letter-spacing:0.25px;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">3–8 years’ experience in clinical research operations</span></li><li style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:3px 0px;letter-spacing:0.25px;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proven leadership of multi-country clinical trial portfolios</span></li><li style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:3px 0px;letter-spacing:0.25px;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong expertise in ICH-GCP, quality, and regulatory compliance</span></li><li style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:3px 0px;letter-spacing:0.25px;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">High adaptability in fast-paced, multi-country environments</span></li><li style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:3px 0px;letter-spacing:0.25px;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Strong tech-savviness and data-driven decision-making</span></li><li style=\"font-size:12pt;margin:3px 0px;letter-spacing:0.25px;line-height:1.6;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ability to influence at executive and cross-functional levels</span><br><br></li></ul><p style=\"font-family:&quot;Basel Grotesk&quot;,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;margin:4px 0px;padding:0px;\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Apply by 17 April 2026</span></p>"
   },
